hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1330","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Bashar, narrated by Yahya, narrated by Ubayd Allah, Nafi’ informed me, on the authority of Ibn Umar, he said: “I used to spend the night in the mosque during the covenant of The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and I am single.”"
